lokihouse (0.7.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Status changed from work in progress to release candidate.
  * Multi-tenant index stats, volume, detected_labels and patterns.
  * New clickhouse.dial_timeout, read_timeout, max_open_conns and
    max_idle_conns; /ready reports ClickHouse reachability.
  * Processed delete requests physically remove rows; delete_requests is
    a ReplacingMergeTree(version); line filters use the line_text index.
  * Pushes spanning more than 60 partitions are rejected with 400.

 -- Bernd Zeimetz <bernd@bzed.de>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0200

